y, 'I'll find her'\nDtaemi says 'Thank you. I don't know where she is now, but we had talked to one scientist type guy who was here looking at the plants. Maybe he knows where she is.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Down the Hole'.\nDtaemi needs your help to track down his mother, who has not seen him since he was lost long ago.\n\n---\n\nSpeak to Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Giladan the Botanist is found at location -65, -1700, -105 (due east of the zone-in; just east of the central garden and next to Spensur, the Rk. III spell NPC)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'I've got too much going on right now to answer questions. If someone can deal with those rotdogs, I am sure I would have more time for inquiries.'\nKill 5 rotdogs 0/5 (The Grounds)\n_Kill any five rotdogs to update this step. Note: Only \"a rotdog\" will update this task._\nSpeak to Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'A young boy? I do remember a while back some mother looking for her son. He'd apparently gotten lost but they could not find him. Quite a few searchers fell to the creature here in the garden looking for him. So they eventually had to call off the search. She finally left and went back to speak to Shalma in Feerrott about supplies. But I never saw her again.'\nSpeak to Shalma in the Feerrott 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n_Shalma is found in the Feerrott just north of the zone-in from the House of Thule. She's on the east side of the riverbank. There are undead mobs in the water, so keep a lookout._\nYou say, 'Hail, Shalma'\nShalma says 'Yes, I remember that woman. She had no means to pay for anything. But besides that, no one was willing to go look for her son since there were too many who had not returned from the last time they searched. I'd look for any signs that she'd been killed here in Feerrott.'\nKill 10 Tae Ew 0/10 (The Feerrott)\n_Any \"a Tae Ew \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\" will do._\nSpeak to Dtaemi 0/1 (The Well)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dtaemi'\nYou have found out that Dtaemi's mother most likely died trying to search for him.\nDtaemi says 'But if she has moved on, what is keeping me here? Thank you, but I may need your help again soon.'\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum\nExperience (about 3 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n17 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
