igned the task 'All Alone'.\nDtaemi is convinced that his mother may still be alive. You will need to help him find evidence of her death or proof that she is alive.\n\n---\n\nKill 3 rotdogs 0/3 (The Grounds)\nKill 3 souring treants 0/3 (The Grounds)\nKill 3 servants of Thule 0/3 (The Grounds)\nLoot Cela's Necklace from a servant of Thule 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_This is a common drop from the servants._\nReturn Cela's Necklace to Dtaemi 0/1 (The Well)\nSpeak with Dtaemi 0/1 (The Well)\nYou have discovered proof of Dtaemi's mother's death. This means that something else is keeping him here.\nDtaemi says 'You found her necklace? I guess I was hoping that she was still out there somewhere. Thank you. Now at least I know that something else is keeping me here. I'll just have to find out what.'\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum\nExperience (about 3 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n17 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
