nesmith 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Bone golems are found throughout the northeastern corner of the Grounds. The Bonesmith is found inside the building in the same area._\nYou say, 'Hail, Ikaena the Bonesmith'\nIkaena the Bonesmith says 'If Dtaemi will not move on, it is because of the Adversary. It lives to corrupt everything good. It is the main reason nothing ever returns from the well. It is bound to the mouths of insanity that inhabit the well. I'd start there.'\nKill 2 mouths of insanity 0/2 (The Well)\n_The mouths of insanity are located all along the tunnel leading up from the pit in the northwest corner of the zone. There's also one in the tunnel south of Retta Kole._\nSpeak to the Adversary 0/1 (The Well)\n_The Adversary spawns on top of the second mouth of insanity you kill. Hail it._\n_Note: Your entire group can hail the adversary before it goes active, so everyone can get the update._\nThe Adversary says 'I knew I would be seeing you soon enough! I will devour your soul after I rend the flesh from your bones as I did to that boy!'\nThe Adversary says 'You will never leave this place alive!'\nKill the Adversary 0/1 (The Well)\n_Its difficulty is on par with trash mobs in the zone. WARNING: If you die during this step, or otherwise cause the Adversary to lose aggro and despawn, you may have to repeat the entire task to respawn him._\nThe Adversary has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nThe Adversary's corpse says 'This cannot be!'\nReturn to Dtaemi 0/1 (The Well)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dtaemi'\nYou have succeeded in freeing Dtaemi from the well so that he may join his mother.\nDtaemi says 'You mean I am finally free? I can be with my mother? Thank you for everything you have done for me. You will not be forgotten.'\n_Rewards:_\n262 platinum\nExperience (about 3 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n17 Dream Motes\n\n---\n\n_Completion of this task leads into the Well's progression mission, \"No Freedom in Death\" from the Fallen Soul._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
