      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Well [zone=750]\n**Who:**\n- Retta Kole [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a grown nayat [npc=36132]\n- a young nayat [npc=36545]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 01:44:39 2010\nModified: Thu Oct 20 06:59:25 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Retta Kole in The Well. She's located at -430, -260, 40 (in the southern part of the first open cavern)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Retta Kole'\nRetta Kole says 'You there! Where are we? I knew I should not have left the [camp] site. They'll dock my pay if I don't show up by dawn!'\nYou say, 'Camp site?'\nRetta Kole says 'My employer and my friends are there. I'm a sellsword; a mercenary. And my team is going to be missing me if I don't show up. I must have been exploring the area and hit my head, since I have a really awful headache. But more importantly, I can't even [leave].'\nYou say, 'Why can't you leave?'\nRetta Kole says 'Look, I fear nothing on the battlefield. Retta Kole is no coward. However, deep water makes my skin crawl. I can't explain it. And those nayats here, and in the water outside this tunnel. They cling to you and keep you down! I can't go out there. You have no idea how embarrassing this is to admit, but I just can't do it. Please, destroy the nayats. You'll have my eternal gratitude. In the meantime, I have to conjure the courage to swim in that water.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Aquaphobia'.\nRetta has asked you to destroy the nayats infesting the waters and caverns. While capable of fighting herself, she fears the deep water, and refuses to confront them in this situation. Kill all the nayats and return to Retta with the news.\n\n---\n\nDestroy the young nayats 0/3 (The Well)\nDestroy the grown nayats 0/3 (The Well)\n_Nayats are found throughout the tunnels and caverns in the zone._\nSpeak with Retta Kole 0/1 (The Well)\nYou say, 'Hail, Retta Kole'\nThe jelly creatures called nayets have been destroyed. Retta the mercenary can now escape, assuming she can conquer her fear of swimming in deep water.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
