      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Well [zone=750]\n**Who:**\n- Dahlmar Raltend [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a mud golem [npc=36544]\n- a sludge golem [npc=36130]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 01:44:54 2010\nModified: Tue Jul 7 00:37:08 2015 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Dahlmar Raltend in The Well. He's an Erudite located at 15, -335, -35 (next to the mud pool at the end of the tunnel east from the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Dahlmar Raltend'\nDahlmar Raltend says 'Where am I? How did we get here? Those horrid mud creatures are closing in, and I can't find an exit! I can't remember how I got here, and I didn't even bring a [map].'\nYou say, 'You didn't bring a map?'\nDahlmar Raltend says 'I'm a cartographer, so I always have my maps on me. Still, would it even help me? Especially with all of this [mud] here. I'm going to lose my mind if I can't get out of here!'\nYou say, 'What mud?'\nDahlmar Raltend says 'This mud. It reminds me of the quicksand that almost killed me when I was a child. I nearly drowned in it! I can't shake the horrible memories. Please, you have to help me. I'm sure I can help us get out of here, but you'll need to destroy these mud creatures first. I'm no fighter!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Drowned in Mud'.\nYou've been asked to destroy the mud creatures that are terrorizing Dahlmar. They seem to be emerging from the slippery mud pool room, but might be elsewhere as well.\n\n---\n\nDestroy mud golems 0/3 (The Well)\nDestroy sludge golems 0/3 (The Well)\n_Golems can be found in the mud pool room as well as the tunnel leading out of the area (there's a small pit in the bottom of the mud pool that leads to the tunnel out)._\nSpeak with Dahlmar Raltend 0/1 (The Well)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dahlmar Raltend'\nYour task 'Drowned in Mud' has been updated.\nYou've cleared out the mud golems and given Dahlmar some peace of mind. There are bound to be more emerging from the muck, however.\nDahlmar Raltend says 'Thank you so much. Maybe I can find a way out of here now!'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers (+5)",
