      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Well [zone=750]\n**Who:**\n- Traelphor [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Traelphor's Primary Scroll [item=93036]\n- Traelphor's Secondary Scroll [item=93038]\n- Traelphor's Tertiary Scroll [item=93037]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Grounds [zone=749]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Argamis [npc=36552]\n- Plomaedis [ _Lackey_]\n- a mouth of insanity [npc=36131]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Is Not Forgotten Part 2 [quest=5181]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 02:12:02 2010\nModified: Mon Dec 13 02:43:55 2010 | | _This shared task (1-6 players) is the first of two that begins with Traelphor in The Well. He's located at -310, -665, 30 ((n the tunnel that leads out of the easternmost cavern -- its entrance is a false wall)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Traelphor'\nTraelphor says 'Is it [time]? I am here. Always here.'\nYou say, 'It's time'\nTraelphor says 'But I am not ready! I am not complete! I cannot leave. No life! No life will I have until I am [whole]!'\nYou say, 'Whole?'\nTraelphor says 'A sly one you are! You take my [soul] and leave me here to rot, and now you pretend to not remember! What manner of game is this?'\nYou say, 'Your soul?'\nTraelphor says 'Is that it then? You wish me to relive my agony? My despair? I have not forgotten! I will never forget! And to make matters worse, you hide the location of my very being from anyone who might have helped. Now no one will [help]!'\nYou say, 'I can help'\nTraelphor says 'Surely you will deceiver! Teller of lies! You would do best to stick with mocking your lackey Plomaedis in the garden. I am sure he will do whatever it takes to please your wickedness. '\nYou have been assigned the task 'All Is Not Forgotten Part 1'.\nTraelphor is still unconvinced that you are trying to help him. You must find out what you can from Plomaedis about what you need to do to help Traelphor.\nFor someone who has so little time for anything, Plomaedis sure talks a lot. You may only need to listen to him to get the clue you need.\n\n---\n\nTalk to Plomaedis 0/1 (The Grounds)\n_Plomaedis is found at location -840, -2435, -235 in the Grounds._\nKill Plomaedis' pet, Argamis 0/1 (The Grounds)\nRetrieve the Primary scroll from the well. 0/1 (The Well)\nRetrieve the Secondary scroll from the well. 0/1 (The Well)\nRetrieve the Tertiary scroll from the well. 0/1 (The Well)\n_The above scrolls are random drops through The Well._\nReturn to Traelphor and speak with him. 0/1 (The Well)\nGive Traelphor the Primary scroll. 0/1 (The Well)\nGive Traelphor the Secondary scroll. 0/1 (The Well)\nGive Traelphor the Tertiary scroll. 0/1 (The Well)\nSpeak with Traelphor. 0/1 (The Well)\n_Rewards:_\n315 platinum\nExperience (about 4 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n\n---\n\n_Completion of this task leads into a second task, \"All Is Not Forgotten, Part 2\"._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
