      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Well [zone=750]\n**Who:**\n- Traelphor [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +10\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Traelphor's Final Scroll [item=93040]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Maorda [npc=36551]\n- Raejic [ _Devourer of Souls_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Is Not Forgotten Part 1 [quest=5180]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 2 02:12:20 2010\nModified: Tue Jan 4 21:48:42 2011 | | _This shared task (1-6 players) is the second of two that begins with Traelphor in The Well. He's located at -310, -665, 30 ((n the tunnel that leads out of the easternmost cavern -- its entrance is a false wall)._\n_You must have completed his first task, \"All Is Not Forgotten Part 1\" before you can request this one._\nYou say, 'Hail, Traelphor'\nTraelphor says 'I am surprised you have returned this [time]. No one has made much of effort to help me in the past. And those who have tried have never returned. But I see that the [scrolls] you have found are indeed the clues to name of the one responsible for my present condition.'\nYou say, 'The scrolls are clues?'\nTraelphor says 'It appears that the answers to the scrolls are the key to deciphering the [final] scroll. The writings within it will no doubt appear to be gibberish. But by applying the key properly, you should be able to read it.'\nYou say, 'Where's the final one?'\nTraelphor says 'You will need to find the final scroll here in the well. I have been pondering this. And I think it is the [Maorda] that has it. '\nYou say, 'What is the Maorda?'\nTraelphor says 'A vile creature in the employ of the one responsible. It occasionally appears to feast on creatures here in the well. It seems to have a particular taste for spiders. I am sure if you bait him with the dead bodies of the spiders, it will come to feast.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'All Is Not Forgotten Part 2'.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 spiders 0/10 (The Well)\nSpeak to Traelphor 0/1 (The Well)\n_NOTE: Hailing Traelphor triggers the spawn of Maorda. You may want to clear nearby trash mobs before doing this as Maorda flees at low health. He doesn't cast any spells._\nKill Maorda 0/1 (The Well)\n_Maorda is slowable and snareable, and not much harder than other trash mobs in the zone._\nLoot the Final Scroll from Maorda 0/1 (The Well)\nTell Traelphor the name you deciphered from the Final Scroll 0/1 (The Well)\n_Translation of the final scroll's text:_\nHe lives to deceive, for he is the deceiver. He is Raejic, the devourer of souls.\n_Say to Traelphor, \"Raejic\"._\nKill Raejic 0/1 (The Well)\n_Raejic is the same as Maorda: Slowable and snareable, and not much harder than other trash mobs in the zone. He doesn't cast any spells._\n_The task auto-completes as Raejic dies._\n_Rewards:_\n? platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n? Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
